      <div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item" id="volufiline-100-faq-1"><summary>What type of product is Volufiline 100% Concentrate?</summary><div class="faq-answer">CELDYQUE Volufiline 100% Concentrate is an oil-based mix-in concentrate. Mix 1–2 drops with a compatible cream, lotion or serum, following your product label.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item" id="volufiline-100-faq-2"><summary>What does Volufiline 100% mean?</summary><div class="faq-answer">The 100% refers to the Volufiline raw material used as the concentrate, rather than diluted into a conventional water-based serum. It does not mean 100% pure sarsasapogenin. Mix 1–2 drops with a compatible cream, lotion or serum before application.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item" id="volufiline-100-faq-3"><summary>Does it replace moisturizer?</summary><div class="faq-answer">No. It is mixed with a compatible moisturizer or other skincare product before application; it does not replace the moisturizer step.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item" id="volufiline-100-faq-4"><summary>Where can I find the complete ingredients?</summary><div class="faq-answer">Read the full ingredient declaration on your packaging. The selected ingredients on this page are a summary.</div></details>
<details class="faq-item" id="volufiline-100-faq-5"><summary>When should I mix it?</summary><div class="faq-answer">Prepare the mixture in your palm immediately before application. Follow the mixing amount and compatible base on your product label.</div></details>
